# === 換行 / 文字屬性 ===
# 註:中文「檔名」顯示不是 .gitattributes 管的,是 git 設定 core.quotepath。
#     要讓 git 正常顯示中文檔名(而非 \347\237... 八進位),各自執行一次:
#       git config core.quotepath false      （本 repo;或加 --global 全域)
#     詳見 docs/知識庫/新成員設定.md。

# 後備:未明列者由 git 自動偵測文字/二進位並正規化換行,
#       確保跨同事(不論各自 core.autocrlf)行為一致。明列規則會覆蓋此行。
* text=auto

# VFP 原始碼是 Big5 + CRLF:工作目錄維持 CRLF,git 不得當 binary(保留可 diff)
*.prg text eol=crlf
*.PRG text eol=crlf
*.h   text eol=crlf

# Lazarus 原始碼(UTF-8):LF
*.pas text eol=lf
*.pp  text eol=lf
*.inc text eol=lf
*.lpr text eol=lf
*.lfm text eol=lf
*.lpi text eol=lf

# 文件
*.md  text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf

# Windows 腳本 / 設定(CRLF 慣例;連線設定 Connect.cfg 走這條)
*.ps1    text eol=crlf
*.bat    text eol=crlf
*.cmd    text eol=crlf
*.cfg    text eol=crlf
*.sample text eol=crlf

# === 二進位(git 不做換行轉換、不做文字 diff)===
*.dbf binary
*.DBF binary
*.fpt binary
*.FPT binary
*.cdx binary
*.CDX binary
*.fpw binary
*.pjx binary
*.pjt binary
*.PJT binary
*.scx binary
*.sct binary
*.SCT binary
*.vcx binary
*.vct binary
*.VCT binary
*.fll binary
*.tlb binary
*.vbr binary
*.VBR binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.app binary
*.APP binary
*.xlsx binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
